<h1 style="line-height: 1.2; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 24px; color: #1E4C74; margin: 0 0 20px;">Thank you for your interest in performing at WinterFest Columbus</h1>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">We received nearly 75 applications from musicians wishing to perform at WinterFest Columbus this year. Many talented musicians applied, but we have limited performance opportunities at the festival. With that, unfortunately, we were unable to book your group for this year's festival. We encourage you to apply again next year and to apply for other events produced by Columbus Recreation and Parks. Thank you for your understanding.</p>
